{"name": "Leaping Dungeon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaping Dungeon is a frog vs flies game featuring auto-attacking weapons and tongues with lots of jumping in a roguelike dungeon. As a frog you can jump over every enemy and jump between rooms. Wield up to 6 weapons and 3 tongues at once. The tadpoles are taken, claim revenge on the flies and get them back. Beat rooms swarming with flies, fight bosses blocking the way down, and track down the Fly Lord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jump over the Bullet Heaven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/967c3e10abba221d2fbb1b94197b87fe.poster.avif?t=1789922240\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/967c3e10abba221d2fbb1b94197b87fe.webm?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/967c3e10abba221d2fbb1b94197b87fe.mp4?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your jump to get out of trouble and control the swarm. You can also jump over stones blocking your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/86816de6db8202ca10fab659410cd87e.poster.avif?t=1789922240\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/86816de6db8202ca10fab659410cd87e.webm?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/86816de6db8202ca10fab659410cd87e.mp4?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the dungeon bosses blocking the way down.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use your tongue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/444cba0166abe3bdc73cf5b2f6296457.poster.avif?t=1789922240\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/444cba0166abe3bdc73cf5b2f6296457.webm?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/444cba0166abe3bdc73cf5b2f6296457.mp4?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have up to 3 tongues at the same time to lick the flies to death. Upgrades will make your tongues steal hearts as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use your favorite weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/2ecb541f3ec75b56c44e3fa38d845405.poster.avif?t=1789922240\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/2ecb541f3ec75b56c44e3fa38d845405.webm?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/2ecb541f3ec75b56c44e3fa38d845405.mp4?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The flyswatter is one of many weapons to exterminate the swarm. Use your favorite weapons to squash every bug.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Save Tadpoles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/ca5fe260b7e429731922317349aa3d20.poster.avif?t=1789922240\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/ca5fe260b7e429731922317349aa3d20.webm?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/extras/ca5fe260b7e429731922317349aa3d20.mp4?t=1789922240\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rescued tadpole grants mechanics altering upgrades, like \u201cExploding Bullets\u201d.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Feature list:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tongues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to push enemies away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merchant shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tadpoles with mechanics altering upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of enemies with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passive stats items and special Mechanics items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural dungeons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Made by a person (a frog?)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaping Dungeon is a game made me, Simon the solo dev.\u00a0I make the Art, Animations, Programming and Design.      <br/>All the art and animations are hand-drawn by me with my digital tablet.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Leaping Dungeon is a frog first bullet heaven with lots of jumping and roguelike dungeon exploration in the world of frogs vs flies. Wield 6 weapons and 3 tongues at the same time. Beat rooms swarming with flies, fight bosses blocking the way down, and track down the Fly Lord!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417660/0112f33853cfe774bf8173d2ed032147b479672c/header.jpg?t=1789922240", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Dungeon Crawler", "Indie", "Stylized", "Animals", "Action Roguelike"], "developers": "Tiny Frog Games", "publishers": "Tiny Frog Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4417660", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/SB2I8mZJ3Nk", "first_seen": 1789855200.0, "review_rank": 25}